<body>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Sydney's Fire Pump Specialists</h1>
            <p>Providing Expert Maintenance And Repairs Of Fire Systems Across All of NSW</p>
            <a href="/contact-us" class="cta-button">GET YOUR FREE QUOTE NOW</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience Section -->
    <section class="experience">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="experience-grid">
                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-icon">
                        <div data-bg="https://www.apexpumps.com.au/wp-content/uploads/fire-pump-experience.webp" class="image-placeholder rocket-lazyload" style=", url('fire-pump-experience.png');" loading="lazy"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="experience-content">
                        <h3>Decades of Experience</h3>
                        <p>Decades of combined expertise in heavy diesel plant mechanics, fire pumps, and wet-side solutions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="experience-item">
                    <div class="experience-icon">
                        <div data-bg="https://www.apexpumps.com.au/wp-content/uploads/emergency-response.webp" class="image-placeholder rocket-lazyload" style=", url('emergency-response.png');" loading="lazy"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="experience-content">
                        <h3>24/7 Emergency Callouts</h3>
                        <p>Available for urgent fire pump set repairs and maintenance to restore your system ASAP.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section class="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-image">
                    <div data-bg="https://www.apexpumps.com.au/wp-content/uploads/Depositphotos_30249081_L.webp" class="image-placeholder rocket-lazyload" style=", url('fire-pump-system 3.png');" loading="lazy"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="about-text">
                    <h4>Australian Owned & Operated Company</h4>
                    <p>Apex Pumps is an Australian-owned business based in Sydney, founded with a passion for the fire safety industry delivering high-quality fire pump services to fire companies, business owners, and industrial site managers.</p>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Full compliance with Australian Safety Standards.</li>
                        <li>Ensuring the fire pump system is always emergency-ready.</li>
                        <li>Big or small, all fire pump needs are covered.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="contact-info">
                        <a href="tel:1300012739" class="call-cta-button">
                            <span class="call-text">Call Us Now</span>
                            <span class="phone-number">1300 012 739</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Section -->
    <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h3>Our Services</h3>
                <p>From repair and maintenance to replacements and testing, every aspect of the fire pump system is handled.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-header">
                        <div class="service-number">01</div>
                        <h4>Fire Pump Maintenance & Servicing</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p>Annual or monthly fire pump maintenance, thoroughly examining the valve, gauge, and every component of the fire pump.</p>
                    <div class="service-accent"></div>
                                         <div class="service-image">
                         <div data-bg="https://www.apexpumps.com.au/wp-content/uploads/APX-Maintenance-and-Servicing-1000008759.webp" class="image-placeholder rocket-lazyload" style=", url('maintenance-service.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; width: 100%; height: 100%;" loading="lazy"></div>
                     </div>
                    <a href="/fire-pump-maintenance-sydney" class="read-more-button">Learn About Fire Pump Maintenance</a>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-header">
                        <div class="service-number">02</div>
                        <h4>Fire Pump Flow Testing</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p>Fire pump flow tests are conducted to ensure compliance with NSW fire regulations, with complete documentation provided after each test.</p>
