                    <div class="footer-column">
                        <h4>About</h4>
                        <p>Apex Pumps is an Australian-owned and operated business based in Sydney, founded from a deep passion for the fire safety industry. With 20 years of experience as diesel and plant mechanics, we specialise in maintaining and servicing fire pumps and water-based fire safety systems to ensure your property remains compliant and protected.</p>
